  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside an immortal battlefield, after descending sand, Lu Wei Yin turns to Fang Yuan and asks him to evaluate this killer move. Shang Xin Ci refuses to be enemies with Fang Yuan, even if he kills her. Battle will from those who supply it surges and is absorbed into the small world; the battlefield resonates, and walls appear beside Fang Yuan. He attacks them with many methods. The walls form at an incredible speed, and those methods are already very weak under descending sand. The yellow walls have no offensive power. They gather in front of him and surround him above, below, and on all sides. Six directional maze then joins this move and descending sand; the three fuse into fetus earth maze.",
